 have to contend with increasing <strong>law enforcement</strong>, as well as deadly cartel competitors. Fight with fists, melee weapons or <strong>firearms</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164500/extras/0c7d867563533ae1952a1d1e3a56d108.poster.avif?t=1769828261\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164500/extras/0c7d867563533ae1952a1d1e3a56d108.webm?t=1769828261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>A growing empire needs skilled management. Reach new heights in <strong>co-op multiplayer</strong>.","developers":["TVGS"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164500/header.jpg?t=1769828261","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3164500/797469/e64eb5d7441b686ec1dd8c40137c747b207dd8d0/1748812376/dash_av1.mpd?t=1733875324","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3164500/797469/e64eb5d7441b686ec1dd8c40137c747b207dd8d0/1748812376/dash_h264.mpd?t=1733875324","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3164500/797469/e64eb5d7441b686ec1dd8c40137c747b207dd8d0/1748812376/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1733875324","id":257080424,"name":"Schedule I Gameplay Trailer","th